    {
      "_id": "whbImmBreath0001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
      "name": "喷焰吐息",
      "sort": 600000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "action" },
        "actions": { "value": 2 },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>自口腔喷出烈焰，覆盖 @Template[type:cone|distance:15]{15 尺锥形}（约数米）。区内每个生物受到 @Damage[2d6[fire]] 火焰伤害，并尝试 @Check[reflex|basic|dc:18|traits:fire]{基础反射豁免 DC 18}。失败则获得 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntBurnFx001]{猎杀灼烬} 1 层（已有则 +1）。</p>\n<p>这使得近战难以安全接战：贴进锥形距离就会被烧。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
