        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": ["fire"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbImmQuickBr001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
      "name": "短喷",
      "sort": 610000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "action" },
        "actions": { "value": 1 },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>对准 15 尺内一个生物短促喷火。目标受到 @Damage[1d6[fire]] 火焰伤害，并尝试 @Check[reflex|basic|dc:18|traits:fire]{基础反射豁免 DC 18}。失败则获得 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntBurnFx001]{猎杀灼烬} 1 层（已有则 +1）。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": ["fire"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbImmDeathFr001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "临终喷焰",
      "sort": 500000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "passive" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>当喷火怪降至 0 HP 时，胸口与口腔喷溅余焰：以它为中心产生 @Template[type:burst|distance:5]{5 尺爆发}，区内生物受到 @Damage[2d6[fire]] 火焰伤害，并尝试 @Check[reflex|basic|dc:18|traits:fire]{基础反射豁免 DC 18}。失败则获得 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntBurnFx001]{猎杀灼烬} 1 层（已有则 +1）。</p>\n<p><strong>例外：</strong>若它是因<strong>毒素</strong>伤害被降至 0 HP（或最后一击的主要伤害类型为毒素，GM 裁定），则<strong>不</strong>触发临终喷焰——毒是最干净的杀法。</p>\n<p>因此击杀后不要立刻冲进邻格搜刮。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": ["fire"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbImmGlow000001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "炽心喘息",
      "sort": 510000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "passive" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "interaction",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>外形近似普通咕噜兽，但胸腔透出炉火般光芒，并发出独特的灼热喘息。黑暗中 30 尺内可凭光亮与声响更容易发现它（察觉检定 +2 环境，GM 裁定）。</p>\n<p>对火焰伤害具有抗性；对毒素伤害具有弱点。窒息性毒气/烟云（如窒息甲虫）可对其造成毒素伤害，并视为有助于「毒杀不爆」。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 怪物",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": [] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbImmVolatile01",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp",
      "name": "锋刃引燃（可选）",
      "sort": 520000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "free" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "defensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>贴近猎杀原作的可选规则：</em></p>\n<p><strong>触发</strong> 你受到穿刺或挥砍伤害（子弹、刀刃、尖刺等「锋利」伤害）</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 尝试 @Check[flat|dc:11]{DC 11 持平检定}；失败则你被引燃：速度 +5 尺，爪击火焰骰变为 1d6，且在 1d4 轮后自动降至 0 HP 并触发「临终喷焰」（除非期间被毒素伤害击杀）。钝击伤害不会触发本效果。</p>"
        },
